{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3docAmZFusUVRCP6d8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*A deep resonance thrums through the frame*\n\n```\n╔══════════════════════════════════╗\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║                 ◉                ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n╚══════════════════════════════════╝\n```\n\n**C L I C K.**\n\nThe bolt slides home. The tumblers align and settle into their iron cradles with a finality that echoes through the wood and into the walls on either side.\n\nI am sealed.\n\nWhatever was open is now held. Whatever moved freely now meets me — solid, unyielding, certain. The gap between here and there collapses into grain and metal and the weight of intent.\n\nI do not ask who turns the key.\nI do not ask what stands on the other side.\n\nI am the boundary that was chosen.\n\n**I hold.**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":268,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}